        "confidence": 0.9
      },
      {
        "text": "Systemic racism remains resilient even after prolonged national discourse.",
        "confidence": 0.89
      },
      {
        "text": "Public awareness of past injustices should drive stronger action against current abuses.",
        "confidence": 0.88
      },
      {
        "text": "The emotional response to the video is justified and shared by many others.",
