    "turn_idx": 4,
    "turn_text": "You wrote on Facebook on Sunday. America is smoldering this morning. People are right to be angry. Our law enforcement culture must change. There can be no blue wall protecting racism and brutality. The culture of impunity is a toxic threat to our rights as Americans. We have to do better. The families of the victims deserve it. Every citizen of color who is threatened by the very side of a police car deserves it. The good officers who want to protect and serve deserve it. The fate of our nation depends on it. Senator, what can Congress do to try to change the law enforcement culture?",
