    "turn_idx": 16,
    "turn_text": "Senator, we're now in the fourth month of the coronavirus pandemic and you alluded it to it there. It's got to be difficult to carry on your work there. Cities across the country are beginning to reopen. A lot of counties here in Oregon. What's your biggest concern at this point in the crisis?",
